MockMic — Blueprint Day 04: App Shell & Authentication
#60DaysOfClaudeAI — Day 45 of 60
Part of a 10-day capstone build for MockMic, a voice-first mock interview practice app. This is Day 4 of MockMic's own 10-day blueprint, kicking off the 5-day "Build" phase — turning the locked architecture and wireframes from Blueprint Days 1–3 into a real, running app shell with working authentication.
What shipped today
1. App Shell
Three core screens built and wired together, matching the wireframes locked on Day 2:
Landing screen
Login / Sign-up screen
Dashboard (protected)
2. Firebase Authentication
Email sign-up and login connected to Firebase Auth
Inline error handling for invalid credentials / existing accounts
Auth state persists across page refresh
3. Session Handling
Dashboard route protected — logged-out users are redirected to login
Working logout flow that clears the session and returns to landing
