Why this matters
Interview anxiety comes from never having said an answer out loud under pressure. Before MockMic can generate questions or capture voice, it needs a real account system — every practice session has to belong to someone, and persist across logins. Day 4 makes that possible.
Next up — Days 5–8
AI-generated interview questions, voice capture via the Web Speech API, structured feedback per answer, and session history saved to Firestore.
